[engl]
{100}{}{Seth}
{200}{}{You see Seth, leader of the guards of Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{Tandi kidnap}
{1020}{}{Tandi in progress}
{1030}{}{Radscorpions finished}
{1040}{}{Begin}
{1050}{}{After radscorpions}
{2000}{}{Thank Dharma you're here wanderer. My girl . . . uh, Tandi, Aradesh's daughter, has been kidnapped. We believe the raiders have her.}
{2010}{}{Where are these raiders?}
{2020}{}{Wow. Tough break. Well, I'll see you later.}
{2030}{}{I'm sorry, I wish I could help.}
{2040}{}{That's terrible, but I've got to take care of those radscorpions first. They pose a
danger to your whole town.}
{3000}{}{They're to the southeast. Please, hurry. I don't know what they'll do to her.}
{3010}{}{Okay, I'll get her back for you.}
{3020}{}{I didn't say I'd help, I've got my own problems to worry about.}
{3030}{}{I've got to help my own people. I'm sorry.}
{3040}{}{How much is this job worth to you?}
{4000}{}{I thought you were a good person. So be it.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{I knew you were a heartless mercenary. We'll pay you well for saving her, rest assured.}
{5010}{}{Alright, I'll take care of it for you.}
{5020}{}{Sorry, I've got to go.}
{5030}{}{If you're not going to tell me how much you'll give me, I'm not going to take the job.}
{6000}{}{You bastard!}
{6010}{}{[Done.]}
{7000}{}{I wish you'd save Tandi first, stranger, but, if you're willing to help us with the radscorpions, I guess I'll show you the way.}
{7010}{}{Okay, take me to the radscorpions.}
{7020}{}{Great. I'll be back in a while, and you can take me then.}
{7030}{}{I changed my mind. Good bye.}
{8000}{}{Where's Tandi? Why haven't you rescued her?}
{8010}{}{I thought I'd take care of your radscorpion problem first.}
{8020}{}{I need more supplies before I can tackle those guys.}
{8030}{}{I'm working on it.}
{8040}{}{I decided the little tramp wasn't worth the risk.}
{9000}{}{Please hurry. Only the gods know what they are doing to her.}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{Our entire town is grateful to you for destroying the radscorpions. Thank you.}
{10010}{}{You are welcome.}
{11000}{}{You look like one of those raiders. We keep a close watch here in Shady Sands. What do you want?}
{11010}{}{I want all of your money!}
{11020}{}{Bloop?}
{11030}{}{I'd like some information.}
{12000}{}{Nothing good comes of your kind. I will kill you and rid the wasteland of one more monster.}
{12010}{}{[Done.]}
{13000}{}{Not very bright, eh? Well, watch out for the Radscorpions, and stay out of trouble.}
{13010}{}{[Done.]}
{14000}{}{Information? What do you want to know about?}
{14010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Seth08]}
{15000}{}{Information? What do you want to know about?}
{15010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{15020}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{15030}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{15040}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{15050}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{15060}{}{Cave!}
{15070}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}
{16000}{}{Thanks to you, we are now safe from them.}
{16010}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{16020}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{16030}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}
{17000}{}{There are several groups of raiders. I organize guards like Ian to help fight them off.
There is one band to the southeast of here. Watch out for them.}
{17010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{17020}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{17030}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{17040}{}{Cave!}
{17050}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}
{18000}{}{Shady Sands is a peaceful community. We have our own irrigation system, so we can grow
our own food. If we were not plagued with raiders and Radscorpions, we would have no
problems.}
{18010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{18020}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{18030}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{18040}{}{Cave!}
{18050}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}
{19000}{}{Are you sure you want to return there? It is a long journey, and you have removed the threat of them.}
{19010}{}{Yes.}
{19020}{}{Uh-huh.}
{19030}{}{No.}
{19040}{}{Uh-uh.}
{20000}{}{Ok. Enjoy your stay here.@@Ok, just let me know when you are ready to go to the caves.}
{20010}{}{[Done.]}
{21000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Seth08a']}
{21010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Seth14]}
{21020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Sethend]}
{22000}{}{You should speak to Aradesh, our leader. He likes to meet all of our visitors. He should
be in our Town Hall, the building to the south.}
{22010}{}{[Done.]}
{23000}{}{Good day. I am called Seth. How can I help you?}
{23010}{}{Wub-wub!}
{23020}{}{I'd like some information.}
{24000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'BigUpReact']}
{24010}{}{[Done.]}
{25000}{}{What can I do for you?}
{25010}{}{I'd like some information.}
{25020}{}{Nothing, thanks.}
{26000}{}{What do you want now?}
{26010}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{26020}{}{I want to know about the Radscorpions.}
{26030}{}{I want to know about the raiders.}
{26040}{}{I want to know about this place.}
{26050}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{26060}{}{Cave!}
{26070}{}{Nothing else, thanks.}
{27000}{}{Those damn Radscorpions have been after our Brahmin since we moved here. Not a week goes by that someone doesn't get poisoned trying to keep them out of the pens. Last week they took my brother Jarvis. Razlo, our doctor, is looking for an antidote as quickly as he can. Hey, if you have the means to help us, why don't you talk to our leader, Aradesh.}
{27010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{27020}{}{Take me to the Radscorpion caves.}
{28000}{}{Are you sure you want me to give you directions to the Radscorpion caves? I can't go, but I can show you the way.}
{28010}{}{Yes}
{28020}{}{Uh-huh.}
{28030}{}{No.}
{28040}{}{Uh-uh.}

